#! case: documented sample
ok
profile Documents target C:\Backups\Docs\
source C:\Users\me\Documents recursive False exclude [C:\Users\me\Documents\tmp] include [*.docx|*.xlsx] exclude-globs [~$*]
source C:\Users\me\Pictures\ recursive True exclude [] include [] exclude-globs []
retention 7 4 12 3
concurrency 4 8
profile Second target D:\Mirror
source E:\Data\y recursive True exclude [] include [] exclude-globs []
retention none
concurrency none
